notes: >
  v1.0.0 (2026-06-05) is preserved as a git tag for auditability but
  contains a scientific-correctness defect in classify_dataset; do not
  cite v1.0.0 event-level results. v2 supersedes v1.0.0 with the
  event-keyed dispatch described above and adds an independent test
  oracle at tests/oracle.py.
